# Rise — environment variables
#
# Three of the four APIs need no key at all (wger, Open-Meteo, DummyJSON).
# Only the calorie estimates require one.
#
# Get a free key at https://api-ninjas.com (sign up, copy the key from your
# account page), then copy this file to `.env` and paste it below.
# Without it the app runs fine — the Progress tab just shows a setup note
# where the calorie card would be.

VITE_API_NINJAS_KEY=
